      "html": "<div class=\"grid paths\"><article class=\"card\"><h3><a href=\"/resources/virginia-homeschool-basics/\">Virginia homeschool basics</a></h3><p>Notice of intent, evidence of progress, transcripts, dual enrollment, driver's education and post-secondary options.</p>\n</article></div>\n"
